# Loan Charm Suite — Processing Portal

## Stack
- **Frontend:** TanStack Start (React 19), TanStack Router, TanStack Query, Vite 7, Tailwind 4, shadcn/ui
- **Backend:** TanStack `createServerFn` + Supabase (Postgres, RLS, Auth)
- **Deploy:** Cloudflare (wrangler.jsonc)
- **Package manager:** Bun

## Repo layout
```
src/
  routes/           # File-based routes (login + _authenticated/*)
  lib/
    domain.ts       # Stages, labels, types, helpers (client-safe)
    loans.functions.ts
    contacts.functions.ts
    format.ts
  components/       # TopNav, Avatar, StageBadge, InlineField
  integrations/supabase/
supabase/migrations/
```

## Database (Supabase)
Tables: `loans`, `borrowers` (1–4 per loan), `properties` (1 per loan), `notes`, `contacts`, `stage_history`.

**Pipeline stages** (`loans.stage`, CHECK constraint):
`APPLICATION_SENT`, `ON_HOLD`, `APPLICATION_RECEIVED`, `SENT_TO_PROCESSING`, `SENT_TO_UNDERWRITING`, `CONDITIONAL_APPROVAL`, `FINAL_APPROVAL`, `CLEAR_TO_CLOSE`, `DOCS_OUT`, `LOAN_FUNDED`, `FUNDED_AND_PAID`, `CANCELLED`

**Stage badge colors** (`StageBadge` / `groupOfStage` in `domain.ts`):
| Group | Stages | Color |
|-------|--------|-------|
| Intake | Application Sent, Application Received | blue |
| Hold | On Hold | gray |
| Processing | Sent to Processing, Sent to Underwriting | amber |
| Approvals | Conditional Approval, Final Approval | violet |
| Closing | Clear To Close, Docs Out | emerald |
| Funded | Loan Funded, Funded & Paid | green |
| Terminal | Cancelled | red |

`stage_history` is populated by DB trigger `log_stage_change()` on `loans.stage` update.

## GHL / n8n integration
On stage change (`updateLoanStage` in `loans.functions.ts`), POST to:
`https://n8n.voyze.ai/webhook/processing-portal-stage-change`

Payload: `loan_id`, `loan_number`, `borrower_name`, `property_address`, `loan_amount`, `old_stage`, `new_stage`, `ghl_opportunity_id`, `timestamp`.

Store GHL opportunity id in `loans.ghl_opportunity_id`. No inbound GHL sync in app yet.

## Auth
- `/login` — Supabase `signInWithPassword`
- `/_authenticated` — client `beforeLoad` redirects if no session
- Server functions — `requireSupabaseAuth` middleware (Bearer token from client)

## Routes (implemented)
| Route | File | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| `/login` | `login.tsx` | Sign in |
| `/` | `_authenticated/index.tsx` | Dashboard stats + pipeline bars |
| `/loans` | `loans.index.tsx` | Loans table + stage-group tabs |
| `/loans/new` | `loans.new.tsx` | Create loan + borrowers + property |
| `/loans/$loanId` | `loans.$loanId.tsx` | Loan detail (tabbed) |
| `/borrowers` | `borrowers.tsx` | All borrowers (flat list from loans) |
| `/contacts` | `contacts.tsx` | Contacts list + create dialog |

## Server functions

### `loans.functions.ts`
- `listLoans`, `getLoan`, `createLoan`, `updateLoan`, `updateLoanStage`
- `upsertBorrower`, `deleteBorrower`, `upsertProperty`, `addNote`

### `contacts.functions.ts`
- `listContacts`, `createContact`, `updateContact` (update not used in UI)

## Conventions
- Inline edits: `InlineField` with 600ms debounced save → server fn → `queryClient.invalidateQueries`
- Stage changes: use `updateLoanStage` only (not `updateLoan` patch.stage)
- Dropdown option constants in `domain.ts` (`LOAN_PURPOSES`, `LOAN_TYPES`, etc.) — loan detail mostly uses free-text `InlineField` until option lists are finalized
- Use `cursor/<name>-74f7` branch prefix for agent work

## Done (Lovable baseline)
- Auth + Supabase wiring
- All 6 routes with real data (not placeholders)
- Core components: TopNav, Avatar, StageBadge, InlineField
- Full loan detail tabs: Overview, Loan Quote, EPICCC, Borrowers, Notes
- EPICCC + Loan Quote + Company Info fields in schema, Zod, and UI
- Stage webhook on change
- Migrations for 12-stage pipeline + extended columns

## Not done / follow-ups (build in order)
1. **Property on loan detail** — `upsertProperty` exists; no UI on `loans.$loanId`
2. **Stage history UI** — fetched in `getLoan` but not displayed
3. **Contacts edit** — wire `updateContact`; optional delete
4. **Borrowers page** — link rows to `/loans/$loanId`; consider dedicated query
5. **New loan draft** — "Save as Draft" uses same stage as Submit (`APPLICATION_RECEIVED`)
6. **Missing loan fields in UI** — e.g. `origination_fee`; SSN display with `maskSsn`
7. **TopNav** — search, notifications, quick-add, sign-out, real user from session
8. **Kanban pipeline view** — list/tabs only today
9. **GHL folders** — Tasks, Loan Notes, Documents, etc. (out of scope for first pass)
10. **Dropdown `<Select>`s** on loan detail when option lists are provided

## Environment
Requires `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` (see `.env`).
